{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ee15648a-c9c4-8d63-80e1-2c16723eec41",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T10:42:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nadia Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:39:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, good morning. I have a question about a shed. Well, moving a shed. Hmm, let me see how to say this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. What's the situation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:40:04-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So there's already a shed in the back yard where I rent, and the landlord wants it moved over to the other side, by the back fence. Not a new one, just moving the one that's there. Does that, I don't know, trigger a permit? Or no, wait, maybe it only counts if it's new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:40:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Moving an existing shed can still need a permit, because where it sits matters. Setbacks from the property line, that kind of thing. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 19 Ruggles Avenue. Up in Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:40:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Historic Hill. That area can have extra review depending on the lot. How big is the shed, roughly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:40:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, I'd say, let me see, maybe eight by ten? Or is it eight by eight? I'd have to go look. It's the kind you can walk into, but not a big one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:40:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go measure it if you can. Size is one of the things that decides it. And is it sitting on a concrete slab or just on blocks or the ground?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:41:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Blocks, I think. Wait, no, it's mostly just on the ground with a couple of pavers. So that's different?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:41:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could matter, yes. Either way, since it's being relocated, I'd treat it as needing a shed permit application until we say otherwise. The landlord as owner usually has to sign off on it, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:41:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. The landlord, right. And then, is an inspection needed? After it's moved, I mean. Or before? Hmm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:41:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually the permit comes first, then you move it, then there may be an inspection to confirm it's where the plans said. Whether yours needs one depends on the size and whether there's any electric in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:41:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No electric. Oh, wait, there might be an extension cord running out to it. Does that count?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A cord isn't wiring, so no. But if somebody planned to run power to it, that's a different permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:41:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I'm kind of thinking out loud here. I just bought a scratch ticket on the way, the lottery kind, and I haven't even scratched it. It's sitting on my lap, it's distracting me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:42:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, well, hold off till we're done. So here's what I'd do. Measure the shed, get the owner's okay, and come by or call back with the dimensions and where it's going. You can sketch it on paper, it doesn't have to be fancy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:42:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, the dimensions, the new spot, the landlord. And that's the shed permit, not some other one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:42:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the shed permit. The distance from the property lines is the main thing, so measure that for the new spot, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:42:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, from the lines. Hmm, I think I've got it. Maybe. I'll probably call back if I get lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:42:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. We're open till the holiday break, so don't wait too long. Merry Christmas Eve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, you too. Okay, now the scratch ticket."
    }
  ],
